title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/completion:cycle
catalog: GUI command
target: completion:cycle
summary: Cycle the prompt's completion views (forward / back)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``ctrl+,`` → ``completion:cycle forward`` (also in a text input)
* ``ctrl+.`` → ``completion:cycle back`` (also in a text input)
